#: src/routes/about.tsx
msgid "The replay is a static site: frames, tracks and the storm index are files on a public dataset host, decoded in a web worker and drawn with WebGL. Place search (\"hit my town\") also runs in your browser, over a static place index. Separately, one API contract is implemented in four languages (Java, Node, Rust, Go); the Under the hood page races them. No other page depends on them."
msgstr "The replay is a static site: frames, tracks and the storm index are files on a public dataset host, decoded in a web worker and drawn with WebGL. Place search (\"hit my town\") also runs in your browser, over a static place index. Separately, one API contract is implemented in four languages (Java, Node, Rust, Go); the Under the hood page races them. No other page depends on them."

